WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:21.281
Your roster lives on this iPad and nowhere else.

2
00:00:21.281 --> 00:00:28.717
So backups matter. Open Settings from the kiosk.

3
00:00:28.717 --> 00:00:34.642
A copy is made automatically each day, under Data.

4
00:00:34.642 --> 00:00:41.380
Turn this on to send an encrypted copy to your own iCloud.

5
00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:47.039
It is your iCloud, not ours. We never see it.

6
00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:53.632
Tap Backups to see them all.

7
00:00:53.632 --> 00:00:59.614
Open one to name it.

8
00:00:59.614 --> 00:01:08.623
A named backup is never deleted automatically.

9
00:01:08.623 --> 00:01:16.600
Tap Save Name.
